ApprovalRequestChangesBody.description:
``POST …/request-changes``: what the requester must change (required;
at most 1000 characters once trimmed). A missing reason is a ``422`` on
``reason`` after the ``404`` and ``409`` checks.

FamilyUpdate.description:
A change to a family (``PATCH /api/v1/families/{id}``) with the
``version`` the caller loaded. ``is_active`` deactivates or reactivates;
the members are kept.
